{
  "description": "Given a grid and the absolute index of a cell, produce the four dividers surrounding that cell, exercising cases the native suite does not cover: the first cell of a multi-line vertical grid with unequal lines, the last valid cell of that grid, an index one past the last cell, the first cell of the same grid in horizontal orientation, and a middle cell of a single-span single-cell-per-line grid. Cells are numbered line by line starting at zero. Each divider is reported by its zero-based origin coordinates and orientation; the axis mapping depends on the grid orientation. If the index does not correspond to any cell, a normalized out-of-bounds error category is reported instead.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "input": {
        "action": "dividers_around_cell",
        "grid": {
          "span_count": 3,
          "orientation": "vertical",
          "lines": [
            [
              1,
              1,
              1
            ],
            [
              1,
              2
            ],
            [
              3
            ]
          ]
        },
        "cell_index": 0
      },
      "expected_output": "top=x:0,y:0,horizontal\nbottom=x:0,y:1,horizontal\nstart=x:0,y:0,vertical\nend=x:1,y:0,vertical\n"
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "action": "dividers_around_cell",
        "grid": {
          "span_count": 3,
          "orientation": "vertical",
          "lines": [
            [
              1,
              1,
              1
            ],
            [
              1,
              2
            ],
            [
              3
            ]
          ]
        },
        "cell_index": 5
      },
      "expected_output": "top=x:0,y:2,horizontal\nbottom=x:0,y:3,horizontal\nstart=x:0,y:2,vertical\nend=x:1,y:2,vertical\n"
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "action": "dividers_around_cell",
        "grid": {
          "span_count": 3,
          "orientation": "vertical",
          "lines": [
            [
              1,
              1,
              1
            ],
            [
              1,
              2
            ],
            [
              3
            ]
          ]
        },
        "cell_index": 6
      },
      "expected_output": "error=cell_index_out_of_bounds\n"
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "action": "dividers_around_cell",
        "grid": {
          "span_count": 3,
          "orientation": "horizontal",
          "lines": [
            [
              1,
              1,
              1
            ],
            [
              1,
              2
            ],
            [
              3
            ]
          ]
        },
        "cell_index": 0
      },
      "expected_output": "top=x:0,y:0,horizontal\nbottom=x:0,y:1,horizontal\nstart=x:0,y:0,vertical\nend=x:1,y:0,vertical\n"
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "action": "dividers_around_cell",
        "grid": {
          "span_count": 1,
          "orientation": "vertical",
          "lines": [
            [
              1
            ],
            [
              1
            ],
            [
              1
            ]
          ]
        },
        "cell_index": 1
      },
      "expected_output": "top=x:0,y:1,horizontal\nbottom=x:0,y:2,horizontal\nstart=x:0,y:1,vertical\nend=x:1,y:1,vertical\n"
    }
  ]
}
